  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-5cd4ec0b8b0852146030d521",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "1. 若 |z_i - p_i| << 1，由于极点几乎被零点对消，对动态响应的影响很小。2. 尽管 z_i - p_i 很小，但 1/z_i - 1/p_i 可能相当大，从而显著影响 K_v。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "1. If |z_i - p_i| << 1, the effect on dynamic response is small because the pole is almost canceled by the zero. 2. Even though z_i - p_i is small, 1/z_i - 1/p_i can be substantial and significantly influence K_v.",
